data: {"type": "answer", "text": "You rated three of those movies highest, each with a rating of **3.5 stars**:\n\n* **Thor** (2011)\n* **Zootopia** (2016)\n* **The Suicide Squad** (2021)", "iteration": 1, "films": [{"tmdb_id": 10195, "title": "Thor", "year": 2011, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.5, "vote_average": 6.8, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/prSfAi1xGrhLQNxVSUFh61xQ4Qy.jpg", "overview": "Against his father Odin's will, The Mighty Thor - a powerful but arrogant warrior god - recklessly reignites an ancient war. Thor is cast down to Earth and forced to live among humans as punishment. Once here, Thor learns what it takes to be a true hero when the most dangerous villain of his world sends the darkest forces of Asgard to invade Earth."}, {"tmdb_id": 269149, "title": "Zootopia", "year": 2016, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.5, "vote_average": 7.765, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hlK0e0wAQ3VLuJcsfIYPvb4JVud.jpg", "overview": "Determined to prove herself, Officer Judy Hopps, the first bunny on Zootopia's police force, jumps at the chance to crack her first case - even if it means partnering with scam-artist fox Nick Wilde to solve the mystery."}, {"tmdb_id": 436969, "title": "The Suicide Squad", "year": 2021, "watched": true, "my_rating": 3.5, "vote_average": 7.445, "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/q61qEyssk2ku3okWICKArlAdhBn.jpg", "overview": "Supervillains Harley Quinn, Bloodsport, Peacemaker and a collection of nutty cons at Belle Reve prison join the super-secret, super-shady Task Force X as they are dropped off at the remote, enemy-infused island of Corto Maltese."}]}

